sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client
    participant B as booking-service
    participant I as inventory-service
    participant P as payment-service
    participant G as mock-bank-gateway
    participant N as notification-service

    C->>B: POST /api/v1/bookings  [Idempotency-Key: K]
    Note over B: claim K, INSERT booking PENDING
    B->>I: 1. POST /api/v1/holds
    Note over I: one conditional UPDATE takes the seats (BR1)<br/>price computed here (BR3)
    I-->>B: 201 HELD, total_amount_paise
    Note over B: PENDING -> SEATS_HELD
    B->>P: 2. POST /api/v1/payments  [Idempotency-Key: booking-{id}]
    P->>G: POST /gateway/v1/charges  [key: pay-{id}]
    G-->>P: 200 captured
    P-->>B: 201 CAPTURED
    Note over B: SEATS_HELD -> PAYMENT_DONE
    B->>I: 3. POST /api/v1/holds/{id}/confirm
    I-->>B: 200 CONFIRMED
    Note over B: PAYMENT_DONE -> CONFIRMED, PNR, outbox event<br/>(one transaction), response stored for K
    B-->>C: 201 Created {status: CONFIRMED, pnr}

    Note over B,N: asynchronously, a few seconds later
    B->>N: 4. POST /api/v1/notifications {event_id}  (outbox dispatcher)
    N-->>B: 201 SMS + e-mail sent
